@ Start

$ Background {&/Game/Melodia/UI/Textures/Figma/T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery.T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_CosmicOrrery} none 0

- Melusina
  Sir Melodious? Is that you beyond the nave columns? The quiet petal in my pocket is humming again.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_perch_02.mel_perch_02} 0.9

* Follow the quiet chirp into the crossing. | melodia_met_melodious = on | -> Reunion
* Wait beneath the arch and listen first.   | -> Listening

<@> Listening

- .
  The vaulted stone settles. From beyond the fountain court, a bright seven-semitone chirp answers—keeping exact time with her breath.

      $ SFX {&/Game/Audio/Aud_Source/fx_Amb_SoundScape/Birds/amb_ss_palette_bird01_mid_01.amb_ss_palette_bird01_mid_01} 0.85

- Melusina
  There you are. Always waiting for me to leave a rest in the bar before you make an entrance.

$ melodia_met_melodious = on
-> Reunion

<@> Reunion

? if: {melodia_met_melodious} == on

  - Sir Melodious
    There you are, little bard. Even when the hall is empty, the silence remembers our song.

        $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_reunion_01.mel_reunion_01} 0.9

? else:

  - .
    The perch remains empty, but one bright note hangs in the cathedral air.

? endif

- Sir Melodious
  Hold fast to your keynote. The smoke echo that swallowed the opening cadence has gathered at the altar—and it will not yield until someone finishes the phrase.

- Melusina
  Then we don't silence it. We tune it, lock the figure, and play the resolution.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_battle_entry.mel_battle_entry} 0.9

$ Notify melodia:battle:melodia_smoke_encounter

? if: {melodia_battle_result} == victory

  - Sir Melodious
    Bravo! The dissonance unknots into a clean fifth, and the quiet petal opens in full bloom.

        $ SFX {&/Game/Melodia/Audio/WaveHarp/SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4.SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4} 0.85

  - Melusina
    It wasn't trying to fight us—it was just afraid of being forgotten when the lights went down.

  $ melodia_first_dream_resolved = on
  $ Notify melodia:quest:melodia_q_echo_01
  $ Notify melodia:reward:melodia_smoke_reward

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_battle_result} == defeat

    - Sir Melodious
      The dream releases you gently. Catch your breath; we will carry its tempo into the next refrain.

    $ melodia_first_dream_resolved = on

  ? else:

    ? if: {melodia_battle_result} == fled

      - Sir Melodious
        We stepped out of the measure with our strings intact. We can return when the rhythm is kinder.

      $ melodia_first_dream_resolved = on

    ? else:

      - Sir Melodious
        The encounter could not begin yet. The nave holds its breath for our return.

    ? endif

  ? endif

? endif

@ Finish

? if: {melodia_first_dream_resolved} == on

  $ Notify melodia:flag:melodia_smoke_complete:true

  - .
    The First Dream resolves across the Kaleido Nave. Melusina carries its remembered melody back toward the waking world.

? else:

  - .
    The unfinished dream lingers among the arches, leaving a clear path back to its opening note.

? endif

$ End
